      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Runtime admin\n\nSet dashboard variable **`Admin API Token`** to match the Swarm `admin_api_token` secret / backend `ADMIN_API_TOKEN`. Production actions call same-origin `/api/admin/*` through Caddy; the users table is queried server-side from Grafana over the internal overlay network.\n\nUse explicit action panels below for moderation. Every write has a confirmation dialog and is counted by `admin_action_total`.\n\nCanvas resize is expand-only. On success, `canvas_dimensions` updates and WebSocket clients get `{\"event\":\"RESIZE\",...}`."
      },
      "title": "Operator notes",
      "type": "text"
    },
